Upcoming workshops: Short Read Trimming & Quality Evaluation and De Novo RNAseq Assembly

1. Short Read Trimming & Quality Evaluation - March 28, 2016
Instructor: Titus Brown
Location: DSI Space, UC Davis Campus (http://dib-training.readthedocs.org/en/pub/DSI-space-directions.html)

Description: This workshop will cover trimming and quality evaluation of short read RNAseq data. We will use a stock data set and do analysis on the Amazon cloud.

This workshop will be broadcast via YouTube for those who wish to participate remotely.

For more information: http://dib-training.readthedocs.org/en/pub/2016-03-28-short-read-trim-qual-br.html <http://dib-training.readthedocs.org/en/pub/2016-02-17-regular-expressions-python.html>

Register here (only if planning to come to the classroom): https://www.eventbrite.com/e/de-novo-mrnaseq-assembly-tickets-23826325180

2. De Novo RNAseq Assembly - March 30, 2016
Instructor: Titus Brown
Location: DSI Space, UC Davis Campus (http://dib-training.readthedocs.org/en/pub/DSI-space-directions.html <http://g.readthedocs.org/en/pub/DSI-space-directions.html>)

Description: This workshop will cover the assembly of de novo RNAseq data. We will use a stock data set and do analysis on the Amazon cloud.

For more information: http://dib-training.readthedocs.org/en/pub/2016-03-30-de-novo-mrnaseq-assem.html <http://dib-training.readthedocs.org/en/pub/2016-02-19-scipy-lr.html>

Register here: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/de-novo-mrnaseq-assembly-tickets-23826325180

